{
  "note": "Wire-shaped request bodies for the Qwen commercial public-template oracle (QC-V2). Each case is rendered by commercial-reference-render.py through real Jinja2 under preserve_thinking in {undefined, false} x reasoning_effort in {undefined (xhigh), medium (no instruction)}, with the transformers/vLLM tojson (wire key order). `model` is replaced per leaf by the tests; the Jinja reference never reads it. Hand-written controlled inputs, not upstream observations.",
  "tool": {
    "type": "function",
